{% comment %}
  Black Friday landing page (templates/collection.black-friday.json), in the look of the
  Black Friday ads: black marble, "BLACK" in ivory and "FRIDAY" in gold leaf, gold pills
  and seals, red-struck old prices and big gold prices with raised decimals.

  - Hero: brand line, "Starts today / Black Friday" (the line above the title follows the
    start date: soon, today, running), "up to -X%" computed from the deals on the page,
    "From 23 October", an optional countdown (to the start, then to the end date) and the
    button. Desktop: the ads' living room at both edges; phones: under the copy.
  - "The hottest deals": poster cards like the ads (snippets/alc-bf-poster) for the products
    picked in the editor (the ads' products), else the collection's deepest deals.
  - "All deals, by category": one row per second-level collection of the "Produse" menu,
    each with its in-stock products, biggest discount first (sections/alc-bf-rail, fetched
    as the row nears the screen), plus a first row with the collection's own products.

  The product cards are the shared ones (snippets/alc-card-product), re-skinned for the dark
  page by assets/alc-offer-page.css (the October Sale page) and assets/alc-black-friday.css.
  Texts have built-in translations for every storefront language.
{% endcomment %}
{{ 'component-alc-card.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'quick-add.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'alc-offer-page.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'alc-black-friday.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'alc-black-friday.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{%- comment -%} Add to cart on the posters and the cards: Dawn's product-form and quick-add. {%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'product-form.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'quick-add.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
